[`GALLERY_HEADER.rst` becomes the default (rather than `README.rst`) after `sphinx-gallery>=0.17.0`](https://sphinx-gallery.github.io/stable/changes.html#v0-17-0
), which was released on [2024-07-21](https://github.com/sphinx-gallery/sphinx-gallery/releases/tag/v0.17.0).
